{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Behold the blood of the covenant.</b> That was divided into two halves, for such is the way of those who cut a covenant, as it is stated: 'the calf which they cut in two and passed between its pieces.' And the reason it did not cut a covenant between the pieces of the animal, as we find with Abraham our father, is to inform them that He will exact retribution from them in blood if they do not fulfill the condition, and thus it says: 'and I will bring upon you a sword avenging the vengeance of the covenant.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:13.806161264Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}